## Create a .env file in the root directory of the project and add your OpenRouter 
## API key and other configurations. You can use the .envExample file as a template.

OPENROUTER_API_KEY="Your_API_Key_Here"
OPENROUTER_MODEL=typesafe/jev-1.13
OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
MAX_LLM_CALLS=100000
MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS=
OPENROUTER_DECISIONS_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/alpha/decisions
OPENROUTER_FAMILY_MODEL=anthropic/claude-opus-5.5:batch

